<title>USA: Thousand Trails Inc Q3 shr falls to $0.01.</title>
<headline>Thousand Trails Inc Q3 shr falls to $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.01		    $2.17</p>
<p> Net			     49		    8,000</p>
<p> Revs			16,000		   26,300</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $1.66</p>
<p> Net			  2,000		    6,200</p>
<p> Revs			55,700		   70,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 periods include gains of $1.4 million from repurchase of secured notes and $4.7 million from reversal of reserves and charges of $530,000 for a bonus to the company's chief executive and $79,000 in restructuring costs.</p>
<p>1997 nine-month period includes a restructuring charge of $1.1 million.</p>
